{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:80a5ba49b1a90b0aa25f0e70ceb447990d45bf635636cd8e444c673ec4ffe6ce",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc9c5be11dd10f3ea9ccd341540acf50cead6d0b7d92978ddd7b2f4697fc2d49",
      "text": "各自的分歧点",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49457f9041404978f4cfb32906c3b373a1da4514b3f3d219f8bd909a12b566e7",
      "text": "作为父亲的影子写手的一希，正为当下的境遇苦恼不已。另一方面，过着学生生活的大吾从同班同学那里得知了女性偶像凉的事情，对偶像产生了兴趣。凉则为了推好友一把，站在了下定重大决心的舞台上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000009:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000009:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc9c5be11dd10f3ea9ccd341540acf50cead6d0b7d92978ddd7b2f4697fc2d49",
      "text": "各自的分歧点",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62ceeb9f11af5c5604ab59d7ccbbc324df1931a3c27c6290d4856dff1dd0a2e9",
      "text": "…听得到树木的嘈杂之声。\n这应该，是我心境所致吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7d03a022948b24c32d55828191c37aa09a1d355de2af8085dbaf8bf4baa74a7",
      "text": "（…虽说是出来换换心情，但果然还是不行。\n就像今天这样，做了影子写手工作的日子）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c43de2abd57dcf1de5618baea12b82ee87869398d2d73234f031e68f9c19529b",
      "text": "（…父亲，去哪里了呢。\n去书房给他送原稿，但他不在呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0aba9b5191596592527b5a2eaee4626e390cd14f02b56f2444f53b7834046804",
      "text": "（…说起来，最后一次碰面是什么时候了？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a64d5152f2bb47cc9dfde6930a83b0584b69f2dcff31cdd77f6640e3b9ed22a3",
      "text": "（…对了，那是和今天一样，\n完成了父亲的原稿的那一天）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33c9d0c9794a2a7c5b0bdd595242ad06dc76c86c087c37c3b464bc9f9f3a8ebe",
      "text": "…明明是一家人，\n居然能这么久都不碰面啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a76d8fb94b5c27aa31fafba90fc2c9a0640099592c656e8aee0f452349914fc1",
      "text": "（…在我小的时候，并不是这样的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a420d2c24b98da6d6397e5ebdfc5c9964789ac440437862476203396a5b704f",
      "text": "（…父亲会把自己写的书，读给我听）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5cd7847313e7604dfd9b6fb118855c3317bb30a241c4468f2f573baffdf0109",
      "text": "（…我写的作文，\n他也会夸我写得好）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb24956c5a58ccfaba140b0430bd1e3a42f4264f6bb447d77afc0159bb8d95d0",
      "text": "（…被夸奖固然开心，\n但最让我开心的，莫过于能让他感到高兴）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:365dfd95b5a4e5e15710fce2d8815c04ed9cbab93a713b4d367bec596ed1591d",
      "text": "（…但是，那样的日子，也随着父亲\n陷入低谷而结束了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b084692658e6dcce5e3cf30565793fa164581ab83c9c2512ad8d9b10826cd621",
      "text": "…父亲，今天也在书房吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a59a73c63f81c16e290b5a15455d072edc6d94471d07c062866287f778dc8c7b",
      "text": "为什么……\n为什么词句浮现不出来……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62eadb1787d0002880c91b8e120ba0122d307cbc531c4a3ed852bea1530e7a5b",
      "text": "（…不仅是一起吃饭，\n就连交谈的机会都越来越少了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d45e473c278c106c4c983ecb7da34f420c320beb38fdc7f6eb9918478b6855ca",
      "text": "（…在母亲也离开了的家里，我很寂寞。\n所以，无论如何我都想争取和父亲在一起的时间）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c818a7b7d9ff3670536c092ff1a941fd0e413f7f465a6661c68ca5a2d8a93d9",
      "text": "（…我想着他夸奖我作文时的笑容，\n拿起了笔）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86237f2f6555789d6eae3cb9ca26ac09d410758813b405de4c8a7e00677d48ff",
      "text": "…我的小说，怎么样呢。\n哪怕能帮上父亲一点点忙……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8193d5661ec72d1aab420d41cec91cf9c759e34fe7ea1b780a902a6da714aab9",
      "text": "……啊，真厉害啊。写得很好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcc61f3b4c0177ada6117cfdf7c0fb8a06c6ea267b507434eeec94677e79ef49",
      "text": "…真的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d273389effe9d7df9336cecc8e28c72ad5993af9a4663eb7b5fdf3f910b7a49a",
      "text": "嗯，一希很有才能。\n试着写写属于你自己的小说怎么样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_b:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:203f8b5f355d398c5b1c6955976e2ac01c36663b0ddb2f1e5060dc0287f5948d",
      "text": "…我只要，能帮上父亲的忙就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91da5009502255fd328063549bce8732a1cf8137b35773c3081e14996f35fad9",
      "text": "……这样啊。\n谢谢你，一希……我很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_c:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:765a387a6cac7063e13b80b0156198f9cff06aeb9bfaf0933f909f9a983a5ab7",
      "text": "（…明明一开始帮父亲写小说，\n只是想让他高兴而已）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_c:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:567565fc2948462b3601a8b02648b765a57497c79b5fbe833a9aaa36ddae97be",
      "text": "（…随着那部小说受到社会的评价，\n我们之间的关系也变得不正常了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b4d8d315f97f92d5c79a59319817c55fc2ad3d14fc75b8ba730483428192fba",
      "text": "（…恐怕父亲，比我更早察觉，\n也为此苦恼着）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a21f0bee0467693d358885719af3f05510da945beffc7c28eeea0db085927bcc",
      "text": "（…察觉到影子写手的存在，这个秘密，\n对任何人都没有好处……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5d79630dbd40a26e0d6f1531a83cab29cdebe3de592aaf78f054ab184aebf5a",
      "text": "（…我也该更早注意到的。\n契机明明多得是）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21b6da69e3171e6447845454d35b67440fab7acff05f60c1fb9285987cea49b5",
      "text": "（…在父亲的态度变得冷漠的时候。\n甚至到了最后，连眼神都不再对上的时候……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57f4328f0b2be0dc6079fd1d629f92dfc9f3b949f7c2af67e091e827b669b6a3",
      "text": "…无论怎么后悔，都已经太迟了吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:933eb6f87e17b08e5d2fa89b5be230341981ba7d55d6c581256f0ad5e3bbf156",
      "text": "（…不该是这样的。\n我只是，想看到父亲的笑容而已）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edecb655fc5ed51274056e02798d0a660c70ffd41d0863c41c6a95a493e61f99",
      "text": "…笑容。\n最后一次看到父亲的笑容，是什么时候了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62c62fd9ef2600a0c583aae8fbfe9e51fd280255736f83903c4e86a158b71b6a",
      "text": "（…我已经想不起来了，父亲）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:134a08b61c9421d2d079dc11faa49e99d0711b306d2b7be5521c931e29308925",
      "text": "…长到让人想不起来的时间里，\n既没有笑容也没有交谈啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0f207817a83b873e4d6ac8d005527317306678b11d59307c69865b5920e3f4c",
      "text": "（…对父亲来说，在成为家人之前，\n“九十九一希”就先是“幽灵”了吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94ae624845083cf751c305a55811d2493adf674d10bead6706649941f17f34e9",
      "text": "…明明身在其中，却不能存在于此。\n…现在的我，简直就像幽灵一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d29292ca532b07a440858568280558bf7456d772daa102a837352729588ea47a",
      "text": "（…这个秘密，对谁都没有好处。\n对我们两个人，对与我们两人的书相关的所有人来说都一样）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b924e14ab9f83da7fe676d9718798ef90203d6771aae91195cde3e5405811f2",
      "text": "（…是的，我比谁都清楚这一点。\n即便如此也没能停下来，一步步走到了今天）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d07e81ac819fd6c3edc685e46b0dbb5973af43731666991bb8ee3d84f4583691",
      "text": "…父亲，我们到底该怎么办？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:253e0549db75bc5033b5dfd108197919f8fad59e497d4f89822de28c76b645b0",
      "text": "（…如果我没有这种才能的话。\n要是当不了什么影子写手就好了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1638778bd2d468e53146620a2b43a1499ab6ddb490f85ab4a78070933da09454",
      "text": "（…但是，曾经也有过因为我的文字，\n让父亲展露笑容的时候啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77ab0ab9235752527d9d5eeec8dbbc4c91c9e8287470ff37198a4c246bccf38e",
      "text": "…我到底，该如何是好……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6444c321a6d372f2f83f1a5886a883687c2dbf70811a722ebf3409a49c27324f",
      "text": "（哎呀，不好。班会结束之后\n就一直在发呆。得准备回家了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ae93e1448f80cb32bb9bbcc892e87e95269c24d6c22325878dc2102cc662b1f",
      "text": "喂——兜。接你的人又来了哦。\n今天的约定没问题吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:401db8ca43daa87a2216273a403291388d6d9358cd72f2fbaf25247bddfebe36",
      "text": "嗯？接我？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:436ec7dcff435b7e7fde0c67c6f3c5fd13cc86b4e7af7e08848c38a9649bde50",
      "text": "对啊，校门附近停了辆黑色的车。\n还有穿黑衣服的人在，是你家里人吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:148f9b5161081711d41bcfbdc5c1b32dd4fe4e620912d72f84b37d381a309c40",
      "text": "真是的。那些家伙，又来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:489b3e960256c4a4d499fd845fc3198f697d50431ac03cf787df68fc640dd674",
      "text": "（今天也是来接送俺的吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2e6bb1c590d60c1c17b1ef1d4e7abc6d5a1431170cb532be85b76c8fe4d2368",
      "text": "（俺明明都已经让出继承权了。\n都说了不需要像以前那样的护卫了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbe127b26a20d71a940a6720161fe5decaf4682437c3551f8cc8231ce90b3071",
      "text": "（不过，这也是为了俺好，\n俺也没法说重话。真没办法啊～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:499ed7098c02ea8100390c3b41a69f6829e2557e383b27c2211185163ffc350f",
      "text": "俺去稍微交涉一下。\n不好意思，你们先去店里吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8aaadfa816601eb6ef72121d178f5f6567f381601d027a5b24d2acbe1aef199e",
      "text": "知道了，快点来哦——",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_f:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d8a6559c77b0ef566bd25de03f1a0568184ba31df80fe6941269b92faadd508",
      "text": "抱歉啊～让你们久等了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_f:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cabc3a0ad019ea6443f65dfaee5ff800b3eaa821fb6264d89a86a1c3eadee0ab",
      "text": "没事没事！\n你家里的人，没问题了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_f:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70f232d9271e2d03502e709cf20830936170c70c012c3015944658ad9ffbcf0e",
      "text": "噢，没事了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_f:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3476a502d3f03f6dd6160e73ce5c8882808c3e3fd4ecac8977134ec158c1584e",
      "text": "（……还在跟着俺。\n真是爱瞎操心啊～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:656f7e434fb4d31df639664133debceeff44dd96a103ac9eb427c8389ac1c8a7",
      "text": "（俺明明都已经辞去第六代当家了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_f:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78a6d29f2a990edece29aebaee0b93a18b33256d6e520b6b1c05af0de9962b22",
      "text": "（家里的骚动应该很快就会平息下来，\n大哥他们身边的人应该也不会做什么才对……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_f:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97df86cf0b55d227430f9b41f925036d0ba9a902956cc0afa4bee34759d6d8fa",
      "text": "（不过无论怎么解释他们也不听，\n也只能等到他们自己接受了吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23506ecd5e5845574a7f8e7909b256c999f5bc5a6698aeade557c55013926b5a",
      "text": "噢，这首歌不是秋月凉的吗？\n我可是粉丝哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_f:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ea374af195c0646f4387fdeabfbe3bbc2cd0411fc83eecfb4f139cd6c31abf9",
      "text": "我也是我也是！\n歌声和笑容都超级可爱的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60594228f4b7bb93587a8395308331c2ddaf97f50cf5a5e1249718ed03db7c1d",
      "text": "真想和秋月凉那样的女孩子交往啊……\n兜也是这么觉得的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_f:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff412a9fd0a136df85c6558e9269015ed1c2d7ef631a630adc959c330b423ea5",
      "text": "秋月凉？……是个很有名的人吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_g:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea1323d5ec6271c4f99bfb2b85e48267f39dc71ff0e80142fbd5d3dbc1d5d3ae",
      "text": "诶，真的假的！？你连凉酱都不知道吗。\n那你人生绝对亏大了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_g:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:534cc08c96fad2ac7fc2ac250c03cbf0d4c9d6bd91d4d3c37468913a5b012b0e",
      "text": "这家店应该也有CD，我指给你看。\n来，这边！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df8d45d585cbb0008458e44a8e94e55ea02da47d07e86bb53a7dbdd37696e58d",
      "text": "有的有！\n不愧是顶尖偶像啊，气场就是不一样！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_g:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:828feede64ac19e38bff6dc42af199809d789d76f5889d8ab5f331af2e550191",
      "text": "嚯，确实挺可爱的呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_g:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:808f0069d32b5db994a67c9f21a10fbea76a3f34c40b2c11eda608ae0191967b",
      "text": "这种可爱的表情最棒了！\n喂，你也听听歌嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_g:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b295ba3e68038e21289666b0d350ed7603b9de4396f68c4e38f7cd32c34fd297",
      "text": "（……真厉害啊，这位姑娘。\n一瞬间就让大家露出了笑容）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_g:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:718c667a63dcad86fd53aab39c90e77d4cc976a62d09e136b033040d78a48810",
      "text": "（要让别人露出笑容，\n其实是件相当困难又不容易的事情）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_g:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e536667fe7a2e6db49e76ebb47f90bfb8cfd2669d55009cae2433b4a767d38a",
      "text": "（所以，大家都在笑着的\n当下这个瞬间……是非常宝贵的时间啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a6526c68c037c7210833e8770f2841ddc095a629891c7366a7547d441c51c6f",
      "text": "（……这位姑娘自己，也是一脸幸福的表情）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_g:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b87c631d3a71b47218e63a5f9b19f968ac235442f6f409b9aab565624b3f763",
      "text": "（能够创造这么多的笑容，\n这就是所谓的“偶像”吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_h:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e39643858608930afdc0e5aab538727ba26d593568d37195eebcd9c5d1d0a6c",
      "text": "终于到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_h:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa8c270ce2e14855aed507eb463b80d9babde741ad986682ded351a1450a7de3",
      "text": "（今天出演《Old Whistle》，\n我作为女性偶像秋月凉，要坦白自己其实是男生……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_h:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed905a251b9468e39fc4d35a7ca442384725571e3bc56e6dfb197370b71852fa",
      "text": "……走到这一步，真的很漫长呢。\n但是，从现在开始会变得更加艰难吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e9341672cc4c4a2fd77d1ca4a31614140fd2f564583da2fc443660081338eb6",
      "text": "（肯定会引起轩然大波。不仅会让许多人\n大吃一惊，还会给大家添麻烦）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_h:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54514444a3e258a4171ce4784363696b7284774eb5e2c2bc2a65e0473d0c503d",
      "text": "（但是……也为了在今天之前\n一直向我伸出援手的大家）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_h:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:273e6112832a162930eee18070a50b20fc0f630d19c2d29acbe931d719555466",
      "text": "我已经不能退缩了。\n绝对，不能失败！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_h:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d53ba83716248b0f1f0d1c44565509a7b727aa7734e4368642f08db0336b5e17",
      "text": "（……因为我不想让梦子酱放弃梦想）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_h:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:125f6185f0ad8dff8adfcb61da3e913d8453d4ae3e0c52ee475a04d49d5a3ba8",
      "text": "（在今天这个节目里，我要展现出自己绝不放弃梦想的姿态）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_h:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51cf88ad9cbae9063190736bbc45e931a252a451622146dec90ed79732bfa6f6",
      "text": "（为了成为男性偶像，\n我要展现出鼓起勇气迈出第一步的姿态）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_h:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b8c6bf1dbe341188c8c1946aac532927c813bac36b29eabd66bbfbd879ea766",
      "text": "（因为我相信我的姿态，一定能推梦子酱一把的！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_i:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d3f595cf089fff702f7407b539694929da2864b21babbe21110a3108ca22a29",
      "text": "好，得赶快换衣服了。\n离化妆师来的时间只剩一点点了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_i:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24843045253ce9dad6ae571ef7e8899ffb7aa3ee782ec3be6797a41fed140285",
      "text": "……手在发抖，果然还是在紧张吧。\n……啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_i:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5c45e7a3223ad72fdada00ffb357115f023467d977d3b5369d9bd503b299a77",
      "text": "胸垫，啊……\n随身带着这东西，今天也是最后一天了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_i:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e411b437ff81fed7b569c77865f4e49af8e9192132d0d410a64ef5ce061c21a4",
      "text": "放在包里明明是理所当然的事情呢。\n呵呵，感觉真不可思议。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7be86f0170c882732d34e019e6a759faceb59b9816a43742ff5c670720e11264",
      "text": "回想起来，经历了不少事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_i:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33e3147f4da3612f08058d13073049f0c3982aa2357471616698ea771bfc8c04",
      "text": "（明明想成为帅气的男性偶像，\n却稀里糊涂地当上了女性偶像）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea20ed1afcb6f48823cbbc535c76157e4730c1772c4170dcfcf9c87daf8fc274",
      "text": "（突然被要求穿着女装在街上走，\n还挑战了泳装拍摄……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_i:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2cf72230c9e12ad1ba28fccea7a9e059059ecb9f36d1e05ae7f67a5645a577f",
      "text": "（净是些作为男性偶像的话，\n绝对不会去做的事情）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_i:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36e47cc5754fb0bf1e0629563fb84f46a5f6de2e89c4323cb1f15b01ddbcf36e",
      "text": "啊哈哈……忍耐过各种各样的考验呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d0848d72a676d7b7034cc9c117731d9a5328742b3a5b7ed9e31d19458d5e868",
      "text": "（隐瞒性别虽然很辛苦，\n但现在想想也许也是不错的经验）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_j:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d537193f5d1a0bb13f436bad2fbf290bf3108252ce14688dacf26046e669cc0",
      "text": "（扮演女孩子这件事，也渐渐变得得心应手起来）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_j:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7933856c305332ca6ecc18e595b91a06f2364defa4f3e30845b31bc2ff328bcc",
      "text": "（有好多粉丝，开始支持\n作为偶像的秋月凉了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_j:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ede346923c447233a4e4401913b0d3024f8eefbd51cb787ecb814eea220640c2",
      "text": "（一直支撑着我到今天……不，现在也依然在支持着我）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_j:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94dab2a2e9e0a8437c1449325b3b33d32184dd0a83124613bcaba8a7ed27320e",
      "text": "对那些粉丝们，我现在要把真相告诉大家。\n告诉大家我并不是女孩子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_j:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ad7cb663c900e89367cd5d0a55c8c79101ed81074a0412e9a8b0b9a630fd32a",
      "text": "（……虽然也有不安。但我已经决定了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_j:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcafbd1e007f69138e2724c11f08b939471f1d1059fa2e57fb9ce4e6eba8dae8",
      "text": "（不论被谁反对，被说什么，\n我也绝不放弃自己的梦想！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98cdc427e53eac083dc61f1213a4d50f596a3dbd3768ef69745014e4cf3521cb",
      "text": "（我要把这样的自己，展现给梦子酱看！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_j:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63edf572fd728b368ab68fe00f75a6a86dd9fa38fa43c2277b22292fbea0feb0",
      "text": "我要从女性偶像秋月凉……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_01_1_1_014_01:1_1_014_01_j:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7eb27a04f0c74aa782f88791732f43aaa95c8085d2ae1980354d786d3c818829",
      "text": "蜕变成男性偶像秋月凉给你们看！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
